      "id": "sol.ahsme-1965-p14.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Setting \\(x=y=1\\) makes every monomial equal \\(1,\\) so the value is the sum of the numerical coefficients. It is \\[(1-2+1)^7=0.\\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is A.",
      "hints": [
        "Set both variables equal to \\(1\\) to obtain the coefficient sum",
        "The expression inside the seventh power becomes \\(1-2+1\\)"
